    <dc:subject id="subject-10">IFDC framework</dc:subject>
    <dc:description>A teacher’s guide to AI in schools and universities: what the evidence shows, what it does not yet show, and what to do in a classroom with thirty students, one timetable and a weak connection. Thirteen chapters on homework, planning, learning, assessment, equity, safeguarding, AI literacy, teacher learning, the whole school and higher education, with routines, worksheets and lesson cards.</dc:description>
